xt、git-evidence.json 一致。\",\n \"已检查开发者 verification-observations.json 中实际测试命令及输出，包含11 个逐项通过结果、Ran11 tests 和 OK。\",\n \"本次独立执行逐项输出九组输入、期望、实际结果及幂等性；全部相符。\",\n \"本次 unittest 输出 Ran11 tests、OK，另明确输出 failures0、errors0。\",\n \"本次 README doctest 显示导入及四个调用共五项全部通过。\"\n ],\n \"missing_evidence\": [],\n \"must_fix\": [],\n \"acceptance_notes\": [\n \"三个交付文件当前仍为未跟踪文件；本次验收不包含提交或最终交付批准。\",\n \"开发者所称工作区干净应理解为无测试副产物，不能理解为 Git 无未提交文件。\"\n ],\n \"open_risks\": [],\n \"changed_files\": [\n \"README.md\",\n \"src/normalize_text.py\",\n \"tests/test_normalize_text.py\"\n ],\n \"verification_summary\": \"源码补丁、文件哈希、开发者原始执行记录与本次独立程序输出相互印证，三项验收证据充分。\",\n \"failure\": {\n \"category_hint\": \"\",\n \"verification_remediation\": \"NONE\",\n \"contract_gaps\": [],\n \"out_of_scope_files\": [],\n \"missing_tests\": [],\n \"context_gaps\": [],\n \"reason\": \"\"\n },\n \"verification_checks\": [\n {\n \"criterion_id\": \"AC-1\",\n \"assertion\": \"九类输入覆盖空串、纯 LF、CRLF、单 CR、混合换行、Unicode、末尾有换行、末尾无换行及连续空行；逐项实际结果等于明确期望，重复规范化均保持相同结果。\",\n \"execution_ref\": \"CURRENT\",\n \"tool_call_ids\": [],\n \"material_refs\": [\n {\n \"ref\": \"tests/test_normalize_text.py\",\n \"sha256\": \"31baf228b3689d2469fd14f95f90ca53423bac9868996fa9052fc9ac8876a1be\"\n },\n {\n \"ref\": \"src/normalize_text.py\",\n \"sha256\": \"68ab651db3f65927edab5e52962f5c92bc6654c14363e936a0d570f2b497de3c\"\n }\n ]\n },\n {\n \"criterion_id\": \"AC-2\",\n \"assertion\": \"实际发现并运行11 个 unittest 测试，逐项名称与测试源码一致；输出 Ran11 tests、OK，并明确统计 failures0、errors0，同时保留九组实际输入与输出。\",\n \"execution_ref\": \"CURRENT\",\n \"tool_call_ids\": [],\n \"material_refs\": [\n {\n \"ref\": \"tests/test_normalize_text.py\",\n \"sha256\": \"31baf228b3689d2469fd14f95f90ca53423bac9868996fa9052fc9ac8876a1be\"\n }\n ]\n },\n {\n \"criterion_id\": \"AC-3\",\n \"assertion\": \"README 的导入语句及混合换行、空串、末尾有换行、末尾无换行示例共五项 doctest 全部通过；混合输入实际得到 'a\\\\nb\\\\nc\\\\nd'，与文档和实现一致。\",\n \"execution_ref\": \"CURRENT\",\n \"tool_call_ids\": [],\n \"material_refs\": [\n {\n \"ref\": \"README.md\",\n \"sha256\": \"0af74daeacfdd946a47e88d3b3f28d41ef125285084fd5f1c8735859e5caaae5\"\n },\n {\n \"ref\": \"src/normalize_text.py\",\n \"sha256\": \"68ab651db3f65927edab5e52962f5c92bc6654c14363e936a0d570f2b497de3c\"\n }\n ]\n }\n ]\n }\n}"}],"tool_results":{"exec-05a5f6f6-fa03-4109-b590-b0c968bd018a":{"tool_use_id":"exec-05a5f6f6-fa03-4109-b590-b0c968bd018a","tool_name":"rtk proxy python3 -B - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\nroot=Path('.agent/workstreams/ws-20261023T005431Z-9YYF')\nfor name in ['git-evidence.json','git-status-short.txt','diff.stat','changed-files.txt','diff.patch']:\n p=root/'artifacts/git-evidence'/name\n print('\\nFILE:',p)\n print(p.read_text())\np=root/'runs/run-1792977352552/outputs/verification-observations.json'\nprint('\\nFILE:',p)\nprint(p.read_text())\nPY","is_error":false,"content":{"Text":"{\"formatted_output\":\"\\nFILE: .agent/workstreams/ws-20261023T005431Z-9YYF/artifacts/git-evidence/git-evidence.json\\n{\\n  \\\"schemaVersion\\\" : \\\"1\\\",\\n  \\\"available\\\" : true,\\n  \\\"workdir\\\" : \\\"/Users/kriswang/work/projects/ai/codex-claude-ai-workflow/dual-orchestrator/output/w09-fixtures/eighth-20261023/worktree\\\",\\n  \\\"gitRoot\\\" : \\\"/Users/kriswang/work/projects/ai/codex-claude-ai-workflow/dual-orchestrator/output/w09-fixtures/eighth-20261023/worktree\\\",\\n  \\\"branch\\\" : \\\"codex/w09-newlines-20261023-offline-08\\\",\\n  \\\"baseBranch\\\" : \\\"main\\\",\\n  \\\"baseCommit\\\" : \\\"c442fd02fb39d87481bbd940aa5f270947a72a60\\\",\\n  \\\"headCommit\\\" : \\\"c442fd02fb39d87481bbd940aa5f270947a72a60\\\",\\n  \\\"baseSource\\\" : \\\"workspace_metadata\\\",\\n  \\\"comparisonRange\\\" : \\\"c442fd02fb39d87481bbd940aa5f270947a72a60...HEAD\\\",\\n  \\\"hasChanges\\\" : true,\\n  \\\"changedFileCount\\\" : 3,\\n  \\\"hygieneWarningCount\\\" : 0,\\n  \\\"generatedAt\\\" : \\\"2026-10-26T01:19:21.005914Z\\\",\\n  \\\"error\\\" : null,\\n  \\\"actualChanges\\\" : [ {\\n    \\\"path\\\" : \\\"README.md\\\",\\n    \\\"operation\\\" : \\\"CREATE\\\",\\n    \\\"previousPath\\\" : null,\\n    \\\"rawStatus\\\" : \\\"A\\\"\\n  }, {\\n    \\\"path\\\" : \\\"src/normalize_text.py\\\",\\n    \\\"operation\\\" : \\\"CREATE\\\",\\n    \\\"previousPath\\\" : null,\\n    \\\"rawStatus\\\" : \\\"A\\\"\\n  }, {\\n    \\\"path\\\" : \\\"tests/test_normalize_text.py\\\",\\n    \\\"operation\\\" : \\\"CREATE\\\",\\n    \\\"previousPath\\\" : null,\\n    \\\"rawStatus\\\" : \\\"A\\\"\\n  } ]\\n}\\n\\nFILE: .agent/workstreams/ws-20261023T005431Z-9YYF/artifacts/git-evidence/git-status-short.txt\\n?? README.md\\n?? src/normalize_text.py\\n?? tests/test_normalize_text.py\\n\\n\\nFILE: .agent/workstreams/ws-20261023T005431Z-9YYF/artifacts/git-evidence/diff.stat\\n /dev/null => README.md | 62 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++\\n 1 file changed, 62 insertions(+)\\n /dev/null => src/normalize_text.py | 20 ++++++++++++++++++++\\n 1 file changed, 20 insertions(+)\\n /dev/null => tests/test_normalize_text.py | 91 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++\\n 1 file changed, 91 insertions(+)\\n\\n\\nFILE: .agent/workstreams/ws-20261023T005431Z-9YYF/artifacts/git-evidence/changed-files.txt\\nREADME.md\\nsrc/normalize_text.py\\ntests/test_normalize_text.py\\n\\n\\nFILE: .agent/workstreams/ws-20261023T005431Z-9YYF/artifacts/git-evidence/diff.patch\\ndiff --git a/README.md b/README.md\\nnew file mode 100644\\nindex 0000000..2179c56\\n--- /dev/null\\n+++ b/README.md\\n@@ -0,0 +1,62 @@\\n+# normalize_newlines —— 换行规范化函数\\n+\\n+本仓库提供纯函数 `normalize_newlines(text: str) -> str`：把 CRLF（`\\\\r\\\\n`）与孤立 CR（`\\\\r`）统一转换为 LF（`\\\\n`），其余内容原样保留。仅使用 Python 标准库，不引入任何第三方依赖。\\n+\\n+## 语义规则\\n+\\n+- CRLF 与孤立 CR 都转换为单个 LF；一个 CRLF 不会被拆成两个 LF。\\n+- 已有的 LF 与其余所有字符原样保留，包括全部 Unicode 内容；U+2028（行分隔符）与 U+2029（段分隔符）不在转换范围内，保持不变。\\n+- 末尾换行状态原样保留：输入末尾有换行，输出末尾仍有换行；输入末尾没有换行，不会新增。\\n+- 纯函数：无 I/O、无共享可变状态、无外部副作用；重复调用幂等，`normalize_newlines(normalize_newlines(x)) == normalize_newlines(x)`；空串返回空串。\\n+\\n+## 导入方式\\n+\\n+实现位于 `src/normalize_text.py`（src 布局）。导入前需把 `src` 加入模块搜索路径，两种等价做法：\\n+\\n+1. 运行时设置环境变量：`PYTHONPATH=src python your_script.py`；\\n+2. 在代码中把 `src/` 目录插入 `sys.path`（`tests/test_normalize_text.py` 顶部采用的就是这种做法：用 `pathlib` 定位仓库 `src/`，且仅在 `sys.path` 不含该路径时插入）。\\n+\\n+## 用法示例\\n+\\n+以下示例为 doctest 风格，输入与输出和 `src/normalize_text.py` 的实现一致：\\n+\\n+```python\\n+>>> from normalize_text import normalize_newlines\\n+\\n+>>> normalize_newlines(\\\"a\\\\r\\\\nb\\\\rc\\\\nd\\\")  # 混合换行：CRLF 与孤立 CR 都变为 LF\\n+'a\\\\nb\\\\nc\\\\nd'\\n+\\n+>>> normalize_newlines(\\\"\\\")  # 空串返回空串\\n+''\\n+\\n+>>> normalize_newlines(\\\"end\\\\r\\\\n\\\")  # 末尾有换行：规范化为 LF 后仍保留\\n+'end\\\\n'\\n+\\n+>>> normalize_newlines(\\\"no newline\\\")  # 末尾无换行：不会新增\\n+'no newline'\\n+\\n+```\\n+\\n+## 运行测试\\n+\\n+在仓库根目录执行：\\n+\\n+```console\\n+$ python -m unittest discover -s tests -v\\n+```\\n+\\n+`tests/test_normalize_text.py` 共 11 个用例，通过共享 `CASES` 表覆盖九类输入：空串、纯 LF、CRLF、单 CR、混合换行、Unicode（含 U+2028 保留）、末尾有换行、末尾无换行、连续空行；其中 `test_crlf_becomes_single_lf` 锁定替换顺序（CRLF 不拆成两个 LF），`test_no_cr_left_in_output` 断言全表输出无残留 `\\\\r`，`test_idempotent_across_all_cases` 以 `subTest` 断言重复规范化幂等。\\n+\\n+注意：unittest 默认把逐用例行与结尾的 `Ran 11 tests`、`OK`/`FAILED` 摘..."},"output":{"formatted_output":"\nFILE: .agent/workstreams/ws-20261023T005431Z-9YYF/artifacts/git-evidence/git-evidence.json\n{\n  \"schemaVersion\" : \"1\",\n  \"available\" : true,\n  \"workdir\" : \"/Users/kriswang/work/projects/ai/codex-claude-ai-workflow/dual-orchestrator/output/w09-fixtures/eighth-20261023/worktree\",\n  \"gitRoot\" : \"/Users/kriswang/work/projects/ai/codex-claude-ai-workflow/dual-orchestrator/output/w09-fixtures/eighth-20261023/worktree\",\n  \"branch\" : \"codex/w09-newlines-20261023-offline-08\",\n  \"baseBranch\" : \"main\",\n  \"baseCommit\" : \"c442fd02fb39d87481bbd940aa5f270947a72a60\",\n  \"headCommit\" : \"c442fd02fb39d87481bbd940aa5f270947a72a60\",\n  \"baseSource\" : \"workspace_metadata\",\n  \"comparisonRange\" : \"c442fd02fb39d87481bbd940aa5f270947a72a60...HEAD\",\n  \"hasChanges\" : true,\n  \"changedFileCount\" : 3,\n  \"hygieneWarningCount\" : 0,\n  \"generatedAt\" : \"2026-10-26T01:19:21.005914Z\",\n  \"error\" : null,\n  \"actualChanges\" : [ {\n    \"path\" : \"README.md\",\n    \"operation\" : \"CREATE\",\n    \"previousPath\" : null,\n    \"rawStatus\" : \"A\"\n  }, {\n    \"path\" : \"src/normalize_text.py\",\n    \"operation\" : \"CREATE\",\n    \"previousPath\" : null,\n    \"rawStatus\" : \"A\"\n  }, {\n    \"path\" : \"tests/test_normalize_text.py\",\n    \"operation\" : \"CREATE\",\n    \"previousPath\" : null,\n    \"rawStatus\" : \"A\"\n  } ]\n}\n\nFILE: .agent/workstreams/ws-20261023T005431Z-9YYF/artifacts/git-evidence/git-status-short.txt\n?? README.md\n?? src/normalize_text.py\n?? tests/test_normalize_text.py\n\n\nFILE: .agent/workstreams/ws-20261023T005431Z-9YYF/artifacts/git-evidence/diff.stat\n /dev/null => README.md | 62 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++\n 1 file changed, 62 insertions(+)\n /dev/null => src/normalize_text.py | 20 ++++++++++++++++++++\n 1 file changed, 20 insertions(+)\n /dev/null => tests/test_normalize_text.py | 91 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++\n 1 file changed, 91 insertions(+)\n\n\nFILE: .agent/workstreams/ws-20261023T005431Z-9YYF/artifacts/git-evidence/changed-files.txt\nREADME.md\nsrc/normalize_text.py\ntests/test_normalize_text.py\n\n\nFILE: .agent/workstreams/ws-20261023T005431Z-9YYF/artifacts/git-evidence/diff.patch\ndiff --git a/README.md b/README.md\nnew file mode 100644\nindex 0000000..2179c56\n--- /dev/null\n+++ b/README.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,62 @@\n+# normalize_newlines —— 换行规范化函数\n+\n+本仓库提供纯函数 `normalize_newlines(text: str) -> str`：把 CRLF（`\\r\\n`）与孤立 CR（`\\r`）统一转换为 LF（`\\n`），其余内容原样保留。仅使用 Python 标准库，不引入任何第三方依赖。\n+\n+## 语义规则\n+\n+- CRLF 与孤立 CR 都转换为单个 LF；一个 CRLF 不会被拆成两个 LF。\n+- 已有的 LF 与其余所有字符原样保留，包括全部 Unicode 内容；U+2028（行分隔符）与 U+2029（段分隔符）不在转换范围内，保持不变。\n+- 末尾换行状态原样保留：输入末尾有换行，输出末尾仍有换行；输入末尾没有换行，不会新增。\n+- 纯函数：无 I/O、无共享可变状态、无外部副作用；重复调用幂等，`normalize_newlines(normalize_newlines(x)) == normalize_newlines(x)`；空串返回空串。\n+\n+## 导入方式\n+\n+实现位于 `src/normalize_text.py`（src 布局）。导入前需把 `src` 加入模块搜索路径，两种等价做法：\n+\n+1. 运行时设置环境变量：`PYTHONPATH=src python your_script.py`；\n+2. 在代码中把 `src/` 目录插入 `sys.path`（`tests/test_normalize_text.py` 顶部采用的就是这种做法：用 `pathlib` 定位仓库 `src/`，且仅在 `sys.path` 不含该路径时插入）。\n+\n+## 用法示例\n+\n+以下示例为 doctest 风格，输入与输出和 `src/normalize_text.py` 的实现一致：\n+\n+```python\n+>>> from normalize_text import normalize_newlines\n+\n+>>> normalize_newlines(\"a\\r\\nb\\rc\\nd\")  # 混合换行：CRLF 与孤立 CR 都变为 LF\n+'a\\nb\\nc\\nd'\n+\n+>>> normalize_newlines(\"\")  # 空串返回空串\n+''\n+\n+>>> normalize_newlines(\"end\\r\\n\")  # 末尾有换行：规范化为 LF 后仍保留\n+'end\\n'\n+\n+>>> normalize_newlines(\"no newline\")  # 末尾无换行：不会新增\n+'no newline'\n+\n+```\n+\n+## 运行测试\n+\n+在仓库根目录执行：\n+\n+```console\n+$ python -m unittest discover -s tests -v\n+```\n+\n+`tests/test_normalize_text.py` 共 11 个用例，通过共享 `CASES` 表覆盖九类输入：空串、纯 LF、CRLF、单 CR、混合换行、Unicode（含 U+2028 保留）、末尾有换行、末尾无换行、连续空行；其中 `test_crlf_becomes_single_lf` 锁定替换顺序（CRLF 不拆成两个 LF），`test_no_cr_left_in_output` 断言全表输出无残留 `\\r`，`test_idempotent_across_all_cases` 以 `subTest` 断言重复规范化幂等。\n+\n+注意：unittest 默认把逐用例行与结尾的 `Ran 11 tests`、`OK`/`FAILED` 摘要写入 stderr；如需保存完整输出，用 `2>&1` 合并两个流：\n+\n+```console\n+$ python -m unittest discover -s tests -v 2>&1 | tee unittest-output.txt\n+```\n+\n+若环境中只有 `python3` 命令，把上述命令中的 `python` 等价替换为 `python3` 即可。\n+\n+也可以把本文档的示例作为 doctest 执行，核对文档与实现的一致性（通过时无输出）：\n+\n+```console\n+$ PYTHONPATH=src python -m doctest README.md\n+```\ndiff --git a/src/normalize_text.py b/src/normalize_text.py\nnew file mode 100644\nindex 0000000..4da4dce\n--- /dev/null\n+++ b/src/normalize_text.py\n@@ -0,0 +1,20 @@\n+\"\"\"换行规范化工具模块。\n+\n+提供纯函数 normalize_newlines：将 CRLF 与孤立 CR 统一转换为 LF。\n+仅使用 Python 标准库，无 I/O、无共享可变状态、无外部副作用。\n+\"\"\"\n+\n+\n+def normalize_newlines(text: str) -> str:\n+    r\"\"\"将 CRLF（\"\\r\\n\"）与孤立 CR（\"\\r\"）统一转换为 LF（\"\\n\"）。\n+\n+    - CRLF 与孤立 CR 都转换为单个 LF，一个 CRLF 不会被拆成两个 LF。\n+    - 已有的 LF 与其余字符原样保留，包括 U+2028/U+2029 等 Unicode\n+      行/段分隔符（它们不在转换范围内）。\n+    - 末尾换行的有无状态原样保留：不新增、也不删除末尾换行。\n+    - 纯函数且幂等：normalize_newlines(normalize_newlines(x)) 与\n+      normalize_newlines(x) 结果相同；空串返回空串。\n+    \"\"\"\n+    text = text.replace(\"\\r\\n\", \"\\n\")\n+    text = text.replace(\"\\r\", \"\\n\")\n+    return text\ndiff --git a/tests/test_normalize_text.py b/tests/test_normalize_text.py\nnew file mode 100644\nindex 0000000..d5c1b2d\n--- /dev/null\n+++ b/tests/test_normalize_text.py\n@@ -0,0 +1,91 @@\n+\"\"\"normalize_newlines 的 unittest 测试。\n+\n+在仓库根目录执行：python -m unittest discover -s tests -v\n+（unittest 默认将逐用例行与 Ran/OK 摘要写入 stderr，保存完整输出可用 2>&1 合并。）\n+\"\"\"\n+\n+import sys\n+import unittest\n+from pathlib import Path\n+\n+# 定位仓库 src/ 目录并注入 sys.path（不存在时才插入），支持从仓库根直接运行。\n+SRC_DIR = Path(__file__).resolve().parents[1] / \"src\"\n+if str(SRC_DIR) not in sys.path:\n+    sys.path.insert(0, str(SRC_DIR))\n+\n+# normalize_text 位于 src/ 下，导入须在 sys.path 注入之后（故 noqa: E402）。\n+from normalize_text import normalize_newlines  # noqa: E402\n+\n+# 共享 CASES 表：九类输入 → 期望输出。\n+CASES = [\n+    (\"\", \"\"),                          # 空串\n+    (\"a\\nb\\n\", \"a\\nb\\n\"),              # 纯 LF，原样保留\n+    (\"a\\r\\nb\", \"a\\nb\"),                # CRLF → 单个 LF\n+    (\"a\\rb\", \"a\\nb\"),                  # 孤立 CR → LF\n+    (\"a\\r\\nb\\rc\\nd\", \"a\\nb\\nc\\nd\"),    # 混合换行\n+    (\"中文\\u2028😀\\r\\nx\", \"中文\\u2028😀\\nx\"),  # Unicode，U+2028 保留\n+    (\"end\\r\\n\", \"end\\n\"),              # 末尾有换行，保留\n+    (\"no newline\", \"no newline\"),      # 末尾无换行，不新增\n+    (\"a\\r\\n\\r\\n\\rb\", \"a\\n\\n\\nb\"),      # 连续空行\n+]\n+\n+\n+class TestNormalizeNewlines(unittest.TestCase):\n+    def test_empty_string_returns_empty(self):\n+        self.assertEqual(CASES[0], (\"\", \"\"))\n+        self.assertEqual(normalize_newlines(CASES[0][0]), CASES[0][1])\n+\n+    def test_pure_lf_unchanged(self):\n+        self.assertEqual(CASES[1], (\"a\\nb\\n\", \"a\\nb\\n\"))\n+        self.assertEqual(normalize_newlines(CASES[1][0]), CASES[1][1])\n+\n+    def test_crlf_becomes_single_lf(self):\n+        self.assertEqual(CASES[2], (\"a\\r\\nb\", \"a\\nb\"))\n+        # 锁定替换顺序：先合并 CRLF 再处理孤立 CR，CRLF 不得拆成两个 LF。\n+        self.assertEqual(normalize_newlines(\"a\\r\\nb\"), \"a\\nb\")\n+        self.assertNotEqual(normalize_newlines(\"a\\r\\nb\"), \"a\\n\\nb\")\n+\n+    def test_lone_cr_becomes_lf(self):\n+        self.assertEqual(CASES[3], (\"a\\rb\", \"a\\nb\"))\n+        self.assertEqual(normalize_newlines(CASES[3][0]), CASES[3][1])\n+\n+    def test_mixed_newlines_normalized(self):\n+        self.assertEqual(CASES[4], (\"a\\r\\nb\\rc\\nd\", \"a\\nb\\nc\\nd\"))\n+        self.assertEqual(normalize_newlines(CASES[4][0]), CASES[4][1])\n+\n+    def test_unicode_and_line_separators_preserved(self):\n+        self.assertEqual(CASES[5], (\"中文\\u2028😀\\r\\nx\", \"中文\\u2028😀\\nx\"))\n+        result = normalize_newlines(CASES[5][0])\n+        self.assertEqual(result, CASES[5][1])\n+        self.assertIn(\"\\u2028\", result)  # U+2028 保留，不做转换\n+\n+    def test_trailing_newline_present_kept(self):\n+        self.assertEqual(CASES[6], (\"end\\r\\n\", \"end\\n\"))\n+        result = normalize_newlines(CASES[6][0])\n+        self.assertEqual(result, CASES[6][1])\n+        self.assertTrue(result.endswith(\"\\n\"))\n+\n+    def test_trailing_newline_absent_kept(self):\n+        self.assertEqual(CASES[7], (\"no newline\", \"no newline\"))\n+        result = normalize_newlines(CASES[7][0])\n+        self.assertEqual(result, CASES[7][1])\n+        self.assertFalse(result.endswith(\"\\n\"))\n+\n+    def test_consecutive_blank_lines_normalized(self):\n+        self.assertEqual(CASES[8], (\"a\\r\\n\\r\\n\\rb\", \"a\\n\\n\\nb\"))\n+        self.assertEqual(normalize_newlines(CASES[8][0]), CASES[8][1])\n+\n+    def test_no_cr_left_in_output(self):\n+        for source, _expected in CASES:\n+            with self.subTest(source=source):\n+                self.assertNotIn(\"\\r\", normalize_newlines(source))\n+\n+    def test_idempotent_across_all_cases(self):\n+        for source, _expected in CASES:\n+            with self.subTest(source=source):\n+                once = normalize_newlines(source)\n+                self.assertEqual(normalize_newlines(once), once)\n+\n+\n+if __name__ == \"__main__\":\n+    unittest.main()\n\n\nFILE: .agent/workstreams/ws-20261023T005431Z-9YYF/runs/run-1792977352552/outputs/verification-observations.json\n{\n  \"schema\" : \"dual.verification.observations.v1\",\n  \"workstream\" : \"ws-20261023T005431Z-9YYF\",\n  \"node\" : \"node-implement-claude_self_test_report-031\",\n  \"execution\" : \"nxe-1792977352504-5278efa1\",\n  \"run\" : \"run-1792977352552\",\n  \"agent\" : \"claude\",\n  \"prepared\" : {\n    \"ref\" : \".agent/workstreams/ws-20261023T005431Z-9YYF/runs/run-1792977352552/outputs/nxe-1792977352504-5278efa1-prepared.json\",\n    \"sha256\" : \"9e3bb4ce84f86d938bf51a45b4857495dd23ede725db76ab0a176aca79015e97\"\n  },\n  \"baseline\" : {\n    \"contract\" : {\n      \"ref\" : \".agent/workstreams/ws-20261023T005431Z-9YYF/artifacts/contracts/node-contract-compile_execution-027/task-contract.json\",\n      \"sha256\" : \"00eeb14896cb3b591fc84856dc9aebb5919a950f5c6f3ef6eb248956fdfd5505\"\n    },\n    \"source\" : {\n      \"head\" : \"c442fd02fb39d87481bbd940aa5f270947a72a60\",\n      \"indexSha256\" : \"e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855\",\n      \"sha256\" : \"91725055ca3bb19674ff09c0995a77f16d35b2c6eefedcbfe5de2505aaedcb08\",\n      \"paths\" : [ \"README.md\", \"src/normalize_text.py\", \"tests/test_normalize_text.py\" ]\n    }\n  },\n  \"afterSource\" : {\n    \"head\" : \"c442fd02fb39d87481bbd940aa5f270947a72a60\",\n    \"indexSha256\" : \"e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855\",\n    \"sha256\" : \"91725055ca3bb19674ff09c0995a77f16d35b2c6eefedcbfe5de2505aaedcb08\",\n    \"paths\" : [ \"README.md\", \"src/normalize_text.py\", \"tests/test_normalize_text.py\" ]\